      "side": 0,
      "message": "Oh wow, it has in very corner cases. Ti50 also used value 35 as unknown for a little bit as well.\n\nWhat do you think we should do here? It is still a failure either way (but AP_RO_V2_NON_ZERO_GBB_FLAGS is treated special by factory tests). If gsc is running the newest version ti50 version then that check will be valid still.\n\nAlso we will start pre-loading DT with a Ti50 FW version that never used value 34 as unknown",
