      "writtenOn": "2023-02-09T18:57:12Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "We should skip these return codes. If they were used as something else before, we shouldn\u0027t use them for a new return code meaning.\n\nNON_ZERO_GBB_FLAGS should be 36, wrong key should be 37.\n\nIt\u0027s a corner case, but we have  a lot of available return values. We don\u0027t want someone to use an old ti50 image to fudge return values. NON_ZERO_GBB_FLAGS and WRONG_ROOT_KEY are both failures, so it shouldn\u0027t be that big of a deal, but there\u0027s no reason for us to take that risk.",
      "parentUuid": "aebce58a_71fb984e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 36,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 36,
        "endChar": 22
